A default on a union property (model/defaults.go): writing a union value out
would mean building its variant by hand, so the generator refuses it
(0019-PLAN-idioms-performance.md, deviation during step 4).

-- meta.json --
{"version": 1, "agentMethods": {}, "clientMethods": {}, "protocolMethods": {"cancel_request": "$/cancel_request"}}
-- schema.json --
{"$defs": {
  "U": {"oneOf": [{"title": "S", "type": "string"}, {"title": "I", "type": "integer"}]},
  "Opts": {"type": "object", "properties": {"u": {"allOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/U"}], "default": "s"}}},
  "CancelRequestNotification": {"type": "object", "x-side": "protocol", "x-method": "$/cancel_request"}
}}
-- want.err --
Opts.u: default "s": no Go value of U, a union, is rendered
